  "method": "Validated both complete R5_C30 archives and selected TIFF hashes, checked float32/LZW/tiled GeoTIFF tags and EPSG:4326 RasterPixelIsArea registration, read only the 19 x 106 SITE-001 window through libtiff, masked by pixel-centre inclusion in provisional SITE-001 and positive values in both layers, and encoded hundredths losslessly as uint16 PNG.",
  "usage_boundary": "Concept-stage 2018 approximately 100 m building-height and volume-density screening only. AGBH is built volume per total cell surface, not average building height; ANBH is the cell average over built surfaces, not a per-building measurement. Global model error, mixed cells, older elevation inputs, 2018 shadow updating, provisional clipping and later construction/demolition prevent use for parcel or building-level height, floor count, gross floor area, ownership, condition, permit, demolition, fire, structural, utility, as-built, current-survey, statutory-control or acceptance conclusions."
